---
{
  "layout": "main",
  "title": "News Center",
  "description": "Latest updates and announcements from Grokipedia Wiki",
  "path": "/news/"
}
---

<section class="section pt-24">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="heading-1 mb-6">News Center</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        Stay updated with the latest developments in encyclopedia comparison
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- News List -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-8">

      <!-- News 1: Launch Controversy Analysis -->
      <article class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-48 shrink-0">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/20 to-orange-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="h-12 w-12 text-red-500/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/30 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-medium">Analysis Release</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <time>October 29, 2025</time>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">
              Deep Dive: The Grokipedia Launch Controversy
            </h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              We've published a comprehensive 12-minute analysis examining Grokipedia's October 2025 launch, immediate controversies, critical reception, and what this reveals about AI encyclopedia viability. Includes documentation from CNN, TIME, PBS, and other major outlets.
            </p>
            <a href="/analysis/launch-controversy.html" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Read analysis
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- News 2: Bias & Accuracy Analysis -->
      <article class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-48 shrink-0">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-500/20 to-orange-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="h-12 w-12 text-yellow-500/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-medium">Analysis Release</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <time>October 28, 2025</time>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">
              Bias & Accuracy: The Battle for Neutrality
            </h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              New 15-minute analysis examining bias allegations facing both platforms—Wikipedia accused of left-leaning bias, Grokipedia criticized for right-wing talking points. Includes analysis of AI hallucinations, fact-checking methods, and documented accuracy issues.
            </p>
            <a href="/analysis/bias-accuracy.html" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Read analysis
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- News 3: Editorial Transparency -->
      <article class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-48 shrink-0">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/20 to-indigo-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="h-12 w-12 text-blue-500/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-medium">Analysis Release</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <time>October 28, 2025</time>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">
              Editorial Process & Transparency Comparison
            </h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              Published detailed 12-minute comparison of editorial processes: Wikipedia's complete edit history and community oversight versus Grokipedia's lack of version tracking and unclear sourcing. Examines accountability mechanisms and transparency standards.
            </p>
            <a href="/analysis/editorial-transparency.html" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Read analysis
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- News 4: Community Governance -->
      <article class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-48 shrink-0">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500/20 to-emerald-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="h-12 w-12 text-green-500/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 font-medium">Analysis Release</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <time>October 29, 2025</time>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">
              Community Governance: Open Collaboration vs Centralized Control
            </h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              New analysis exploring fundamental governance differences: Wikipedia's democratic community model with 125,000+ active editors versus Grokipedia's suggestion-only system with no direct user editing. Examines participation models and quality control mechanisms.
            </p>
            <a href="/analysis/community-governance.html" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Read analysis
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- News 5: AI vs Human Content -->
      <article class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-48 shrink-0">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/20 to-pink-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="h-12 w-12 text-purple-500/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/30 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-medium">Analysis Release</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <time>October 29, 2025</time>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">
              AI-Generated vs Human-Curated Content: A Comprehensive Comparison
            </h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              Latest 14-minute analysis examining Grokipedia's 885,000 AI-generated articles versus Wikipedia's 6.8M+ human-written entries. Explores quality, reliability, scalability trade-offs, and Grokipedia's ironic dependence on Wikipedia content.
            </p>
            <a href="/analysis/ai-vs-human-content.html" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Read analysis
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- News 6: Site Launch -->
      <article class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border-2 border-primary/20">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
          <div class="md:w-48 shrink-0">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-indigo-500/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="h-12 w-12 text-primary/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/20 text-primary font-medium">Site Update</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <time>October 29, 2025</time>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">
              Welcome to Grokipedia Wiki: Independent Encyclopedia Analysis Platform
            </h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              We're excited to launch Grokipedia Wiki, an independent third-party analysis platform dedicated to objective comparisons between Grokipedia and Wikipedia. Our mission: provide transparent, data-driven insights with rigorous methodology. Five comprehensive analysis articles now available covering bias, accuracy, editorial transparency, governance, and AI vs human content creation.
            </p>
            <a href="/about/" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              Learn about our mission
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
